title: "Demonstration Diversity Is Not Free at a Fifty-Episode Adaptation Budget"
abstract: >
  A pre-registered comparison of four demonstration collection strategies for
  adapting a vision-language-action model at a fifty-episode budget, with 707
  scored rollouts on a low-cost SO-ARM101, released telemetry tools and full
  analysis code.
